1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
45-second reaction arcade for event booths.
45 秒反应街机，为现场摊位快速轮换而设计。

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Edited only from the supplied demo, screenshots and evidence.
仅使用已有 Demo、截图与证据剪辑；未补录新游戏结果。

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Start with one click or tap.
点击或轻触即可开始。

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
No login, installation or API key.
无需登录、安装或 API Key。

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Every run is 45 seconds; results appear immediately.
每局固定 45 秒，结算即时可见。

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Catch cyan signals; collect blue bonuses; avoid red noise.
接住青色信号，收集蓝色奖励，避开红色噪声。

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
The supplied demo shows the actual game screen and HUD.
已有 Demo 展示真实游戏画面与 HUD。

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Sustained streaks unlock 1.5x, 2x, 3x and 4x.
连续命中逐步解锁 1.5、2、3、4 倍。

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Misses subtract 25; noise subtracts 75.
空点扣 25 分，噪声扣 75 分。

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Short rounds keep booth lines moving.
短局循环让摊位排队持续流动。

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Score, grade, accuracy, best streak and local rank.
等级、分数、准确率、最佳连击与本地排名一次呈现。

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
This supplied demo run scored 000600 with 100% accuracy.
已有 Demo 该局分数 000600，准确率 100%。

13
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
One click returns to the next run.
一键再来，立即开始下一局。

14
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Top ten runs stay on this device.
本地前十保存在同一设备。

15
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:08,000
No account, server or Wi-Fi is required.
无需账号、服务器或 Wi-Fi。

16
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,000
A separate display mirrors the local leaderboard.
独立屏幕实时镜像本地排行榜。

17
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Booth mode is designed to reset 15 seconds after a run.
Booth 模式在每局结束后 15 秒自动重置。

18
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
The countdown pauses while the leaderboard is open.
打开排行榜时，倒计时暂停。

19
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,000
One device can run play and display together.
同一设备可同时运行游戏与排行榜显示。

20
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:32,000
This is a local board, not a cross-device network ranking.
排行榜仅限本机，并非跨设备网络排行榜。

21
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Arrow keys select; Space or Enter locks a target.
方向键选择，空格或回车锁定。

22
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
P or Escape pauses; M toggles sound.
P 或 Esc 暂停，M 切换声音。

23
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Reduced motion, focus, contrast and live status are included.
提供减少动态、可见焦点、高对比与状态播报。

24
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,000
A deterministic core owns scoring, timing and round state.
确定性核心统一管理计分、计时与回合状态。

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Rendering, audio, input and storage stay separate.
渲染、音频、输入与存储保持分离。

26
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Project inspected with IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3.
项目使用 IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3 检查。

27
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,000
The IDE found a CSS variable and two lifecycle promises.
IDE 发现 CSS 变量与两个生命周期 Promise 问题。

28
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Both issue types were fixed; final source findings: 0.
两类问题均已修复；最终源码问题为 0。

29
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Environment warnings are listed separately, not counted as source findings.
环境警告单独注明，不计为源码问题。

30
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,000
All 26 Node tests passed in this assembly run.
本次剪辑时运行 Node 测试，26 项全部通过。

31
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Coverage includes input, scoring, pause, persistence and corrupt storage.
覆盖输入、计分、暂停、持久化与损坏存储。

32
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Includes a 100-round booth reset stress test.
包含 100 局 Booth 连续重置压力测试。

33
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:25,000
After first load, the app shell supports offline reload.
首次加载后，应用外壳支持离线重载。

34
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Artwork and sound are original; no external assets or trackers.
图形与音效均为原创，无外部素材或追踪器。

35
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:32,000
MIT licensed and documented for local startup.
采用 MIT 许可，附本地启动说明。

36
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Simple controls. Short rounds. High-score rematches.
简单操作，短局循环，高分复玩。

37
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Run instructions and evidence are in the submission package.
启动说明与完整证据均在提交包中。
